{"lines":[{"y":0.24408860604406735,"x":0.19028623389957952,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.055413691202799487,"h":0.010369299507541507},{"h":0.017608671275112786,"w":0.5432526143391927,"x":0.27508649569447763,"t":"makeup artists have in their kits - but whatever you do, don't borrow anything","y":0.098670398762214728,"c":1},{"t":"without asking first.","y":0.11616515012937467,"w":0.14186851501464848,"h":0.016102291638405708,"c":1,"x":0.27508650364694875},{"x":0.27328358913422363,"h":0.01909440443013577,"w":0.52093332926432301,"c":1,"t":"It's very important to build your portfolio. You should take photos of all the","y":0.13750204872389071},{"w":0.52076126098632813,"h":0.017557814206336175,"c":1,"y":0.15395381397631014,"t":"work you do and ideally show the different stages of makeup application if","x":0.27508649747037189},{"c":1,"x":0.2733564033323006,"y":0.1700489855738635,"t":"you can. But remember you'll need to get approval from the makeup designer","h":0.017494751574527623,"w":0.54671279907226566},{"x":0.27335640679731094,"w":0.53979237874348951,"h":0.017592396078783823,"c":1,"y":0.18604651195362143,"t":"in charge of the department. As you'll be sending your portfolio digitally, you"},{"t":"won't need to get photos printed.","y":0.20348837216390681,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"x":0.27508650608123031,"w":0.23875432332356772},{"w":0.53993479410807299,"t":"So what does a makeup trainee actually do? You need to think about whether","x":0.27501232939046699,"h":0.017794710510339318,"c":1,"y":0.23912660431091703},{"h":0.017494751574527623,"y":0.25577326821714474,"x":0.27335640889462715,"t":"you're the right kind of person to do the job and whether you'd enjoy it. So, to","w":0.54844289143880198,"c":1},{"w":0.54171763102213544,"y":0.27094329420453422,"x":0.2749708086974092,"h":0.02012910702747428,"t":"give you some idea, here are some of the things you might be required to do.","c":1},{"h":0.016138908327501755,"t":"You may be asked to help prep an actor ready for makeup. Some actors will","x":0.27335640256303068,"y":0.29636109159121293,"w":0.53114186604817704,"c":1},{"w":0.54498270670572913,"x":0.27508650129512585,"t":"arrive having already cleansed and moisturized their skin. But sometimes you'll","y":0.31245626319427267,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1},{"t":"need to step in and get this done without wasting any time, otherwise the","y":0.32848837216695759,"h":0.01615823408037409,"w":0.51384084065755209,"c":1,"x":0.27508650002732377},{"w":0.27508651733398437,"t":"makeup artist will get behind schedule.","x":0.2750864990293681,"h":0.015988371937820545,"y":0.34447674425763719,"c":1},{"w":0.51730102539062495,"h":0.014702711512443511,"c":1,"y":0.36773255790385828,"t":"Trainees play a useful role in continuity. It will be your responsibility to take","x":0.27681661525748913},{"y":0.38218519752208846,"x":0.27496409679052081,"t":"photos, log them digitally and print out a hard copy to put in each actor's","w":0.51060755411783854,"h":0.019843386469227786,"c":1},{"x":0.27508650886809183,"w":0.52422144571940099,"y":0.40116279046192793,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"file. This intormation needs to be kept in good order as a reshoot can mean"},{"t":"replicating makeup months later.","w":0.23183390299479167,"c":1,"y":0.41707487728135884,"h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.27335640481496348},{"c":1,"h":0.015976412634986392,"w":0.50701629638671875,"t":"General duties mean doing anything from getting the teas and coffees to","x":0.27676733991972358,"y":0.43868177414869447},{"x":0.27501087996798257,"y":0.45476517655815551,"w":0.54684855143229172,"h":0.017808380954494218,"c":1,"t":"putting on a wash. Having a positive attitude and being willing to do whatever"},{"w":0.35640139261881515,"h":0.016123650873182793,"t":"is asked of you will help you get your next film job.","y":0.47093023262913425,"x":0.27335639708188181,"c":1},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.49563953464837573,"w":0.50865051269531247,"c":1,"t":"You won't be asked to apply makeup to any of the principal cast, only the","x":0.27681661207613445},{"y":0.5089809449229552,"t":"extras. If there are dozens of extras involved you'll need to keep up a swift pace","h":0.018334811179265831,"c":1,"w":0.55551844278971352,"x":0.27501874747147798},{"t":"and not spend too long on each person. It takes quite a lot of confidence to be","x":0.27681661647898809,"h":0.01308139510051276,"y":0.52761627919174214,"w":0.54844289143880198,"c":1},{"t":"able to do this well.","x":0.27508650975015853,"y":0.54360465112343548,"w":0.1418685022989909,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1},{"h":0.013111909341778749,"x":0.27681660429480703,"y":0.56682995097993794,"w":0.27162630716959635,"c":1,"t":"OK now about terms and conditions...."},{"y":0.61894934950432545,"c":1,"x":0.19198595487122902,"w":0.086616325378417985,"h":0.015008277706202278,"t":"PART 3"},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"x":0.19031141823603701,"y":0.64970930210513833,"w":0.031141869227091473,"t":"PHIL:"},{"t":"LUCY:","x":0.19031141888337424,"h":0.011627907349230804,"y":0.6656976741981615,"w":0.038062283198038754,"c":1},{"w":0.03287197113037113,"t":"PHIL:","x":0.19031141919259992,"y":0.71366279047723136,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1},{"w":0.038062283198038727,"t":"LUCY:","h":0.011627907349230693,"c":1,"x":0.19031141886810868,"y":0.76162790676143122},{"t":"PHIL:","x":0.19204152269074329,"y":0.79360465132954139,"h":0.0087209298445511951,"c":1,"w":0.02941176414489749},{"t":"LUCY:","h":0.011087166003366677,"c":1,"y":0.84111339371792404,"w":0.036680380503336579,"x":0.1918674221176552},{"w":0.029512821833292652,"c":1,"t":"PHIL:","h":0.0089640307042713196,"x":0.19199099384622997,"y":0.85743658927244704},{"t":"LUCY:","h":0.011627907349230804,"x":0.19031141888337424,"y":0.88808139512839412,"w":0.038062283198038754,"c":1},{"w":0.47750864664713538,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"y":0.6468023256525498,"x":0.27508650712346877,"t":"That lecture from the visiting speaker yesterday was good, wasn't it?"},{"y":0.66270118984054949,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.52076126098632813,"c":1,"x":0.27335639366048781,"t":"Yeah. I learned a lot from her about ocean biodiversity. I've already done some"},{"y":0.67678769889041113,"h":0.019674000162774652,"c":1,"x":0.2732736373695322,"w":0.53995595296223953,"t":"reading on it, and I did an assignment on some of the problems associated with it"},{"y":0.69476744173821181,"w":0.55709340413411468,"x":0.27335641449868658,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"last year, but Lespecially liked the way her lecture focused on more long-term issues.","c":1},{"y":0.72673198055847699,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.55536331176757814,"x":0.27335640631682412,"t":"be important in the future. That impressed me too. It wasn't exactly a feel-good"},{"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"conclusion because it's hard to see any real solution for a lot of the problems.","y":0.74273255790304171,"x":0.27681660190227947,"w":0.53633219401041665},{"c":1,"x":0.27508650634433346,"w":0.53114186604817704,"y":0.75857242806559155,"t":"No, though she did point to where policy changes could be made to protect","h":0.016136874178224958},{"x":0.27669876878557986,"y":0.77350403685307056,"h":0.015819235895796147,"c":1,"w":0.26157023111979161,"t":"our marine and coastal environments."},{"t":"Mm. But that's just at a national level. The examples she gave were at a more","w":0.53633219401041665,"y":0.79069767418246684,"h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.27508649802828261,"c":1},{"w":0.51384084065755209,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"x":0.27508650000212187,"y":0.80668604658635357,"t":"global level, and they really made it clear to me just how wide-ranging the"},{"x":0.27312402434373778,"y":0.81957025484620372,"w":0.2340846252441407,"h":0.019803639138971207,"c":1,"t":"threats to ocean biodiversity are."},{"y":0.8394240309389378,"h":0.01460338456385446,"w":0.088670571645100948,"c":1,"x":0.27654052114172356,"t":"Yes, me too."},{"y":0.85304408687297817,"t":"The research project she described was impressive, wasn't it? I'd have thought","h":0.016141959551416729,"x":0.27508649574239769,"c":1,"w":0.5432526143391927},{"t":"it was quite unusual to have so many experts working together.","y":0.87053883860842352,"c":1,"h":0.013296011196641033,"x":0.27508650267406021,"w":0.43771626790364582},{"y":0.88445518180559113,"w":0.534735361735026,"h":0.01794814529579114,"c":1,"x":0.27330130410922948,"t":"Yeah, and from such different backgrounds. Must have been a really exciting"},{"x":0.27335639491848035,"w":0.55190312703450517,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"team to work with. I'd heard of a couple of them before - they were involved in","y":0.90116279077137618},{"c":1,"x":0.27335639084013602,"t":"research way back in 2009 warning about the dangers of ocean pollution.","w":0.51211074829101566,"h":0.016095171448565426,"y":0.91707487758181117},{"y":0.051454836164179008,"t":"Test 1","w":0.054018872578938781,"h":0.015490434485102456,"x":0.85964927493652665,"c":1},{"t":"Q16","w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"x":0.85294117697806693,"y":0.17151162799266428},{"x":0.85294117697806693,"y":0.32848837217871074,"h":0.01308139510051276,"t":"Q17","w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"t":"Q18","x":0.85121107317664457,"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1,"y":0.39970930241340641},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395100512871,"y":0.45639534892289668,"t":"Q19","w":0.034602076212565058,"x":0.85121107253894446},{"y":0.51162790706243166,"h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.85294117603168118,"t":"Q20","w":0.031141869227091501,"c":1},{"t":"Q21\/22","y":0.69461035131505933,"w":0.057194455464680938,"x":0.85116055765099763,"h":0.013395576396966091,"c":1},{"x":0.8511953254348934,"w":0.057124919891357373,"c":1,"h":0.011737337639650569,"t":"Q21\/22","y":0.79064295906856275},{"h":0.011627907349230693,"t":"Q23\/24","y":0.8706395346787229,"x":0.85121107377682237,"w":0.057093423207600913,"c":1},{"y":0.95203488379058654,"w":0.022491348584493087,"x":0.88927335675590802,"t":"99","h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":2857}